append_receipt "6" "Wire contextual language through Ava Nexus" "$remote_parent" "$completed_remote" "Inject one state-bound projection at every Nexus compiler boundary and prove read-only live behavior." "app/ava/compiler.ts, app/ava/nexus.ts, scripts/test-substrate.sh, tests/ava-contextual-language-live.test.mjs, tests/ava-contextual-language-mutation.test.mjs" "Nexus-owned contextual projection, compiler precedence, single condition owner, live typed routing, and mutation invariants." "ava-contextual-language-live.test.mjs; ava-contextual-language-mutation.test.mjs" "No browser/terminal/SSH-local parser, authored indexing, deployment, production change, or shadow-worker change." "Batch 2 begins with authored briefing indexing and typed evidence-bound references."
